{"agent":"main","body":{"error":null,"exit":0,"for_seq":9,"result_bytes":727,"result_hash":"sha256:df88b0a0ea76a9dc5a6143584765ed7140d42ad49ace24bb36bd878c99473382","result_inline":"1\t// User-facing failures. See CONTRIBUTING.md, \"Errors\".\n2\t\n3\texport const ERROR_CODES = {\n4\t  E_UNKNOWN_SKU: \"unknown sku\",\n5\t  E_EMPTY_CART: \"cart is empty\",\n6\t  E_USAGE: \"usage: cartctl add <sku> <qty>\",\n7\t} as const;\n8\t\n9\texport type ErrorCode = keyof typeof ERROR_CODES;\n10\t\n11\texport class CliError extends Error {\n12\t  readonly code: string;\n13\t  constructor(code: string, message: string) {\n14\t    super(message);\n15\t    this.name = \"CliError\";\n16\t    this.code = code;\n17\t  }\n18\t}\n19\t\n20\texport function fail(code: string, message?: string): never {\n21\t  if (!(code in ERROR_CODES)) throw new Error(`unregistered error code ${code}`);\n22\t  throw new CliError(code, message ?? ERROR_CODES[code as ErrorCode]);\n23\t}\n24\t","served":"live","truncated":false,"wall_ms":0},"hash":"sha256:eed808195261a15626bfb6dfda1601a90e954d70ac2f8b8cb0edcaac7973b853","mono_ns":10000000,"prev":"sha256:d325f11a9a47d875f76e7ca1f8a7622ac10a04fedf96c564c49c7714206aeff5","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":10,"session":"1f43b662-0f57-4217-99ac-2dd6b43c6e2f","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.010Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_result"}
{"agent":"main","body":{"args_hash":"sha256:c7b8c0564a4850bb4c0f33d9e5801fab54d5da77a740f9d1d596cbf3c881cf36","args_inline":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/yb/b_617z_s2ml933nmr_k7m47m0000gn/T/saga-bench-2826983519/ts-0012-cart-add-conventions/1/ws/CONTRIBUTING.md"},"component":"harness","cwd_rel":".","index_version":null,"tool":"Read","tool_use_id":"toolu_01AwbD1Xy2hD1BHiVw4Ee4hC"},"hash":"sha256:8f2da9f10ff0da56c91eb984903044528864f4c32374ec727015b65afbdf1918","mono_ns":11000000,"prev":"sha256:eed808195261a15626bfb6dfda1601a90e954d70ac2f8b8cb0edcaac7973b853","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":11,"session":"1f43b662-0f57-4217-99ac-2dd6b43c6e2f","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.011Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_call"}
{"agent":"main","body":{"error":null,"exit":0,"for_seq":11,"result_bytes":1098,"result_hash":"sha256:247d08ab2eadfd788bc4363f8c5ddb457f2d5ea80712321386b488b6e4fd0710","result_inline":"1\t# Contributing to cartctl\n2\t\n3\tThe order desk drives cartctl from scripts that parse its output, so the conventions below are not style, they are interface.\n4\t\n5\t## Errors\n6\t\n7\t1. Every user-facing failure goes through `fail(code, message)` from `src/errors.ts`. Never `throw new Error(...)` from anything under `src/commands/`; a bare Error reaches the user as a stack trace and the desk scripts cannot match it.\n8\t2. Codes are `E_` followed by upper snake case, registered in `ERROR_CODES` in `src/errors.ts`, and documented with one table row in `docs/errors.md` (code, message, when it happens). `fail` refuses a code that is not registered, and review refuses a code that is not documented.\n9\t3. The CLI prints `error <code>: <message>` on stderr and exits 2 for a `CliError`; anything else is a bug and exits 70.\n10\t\n11\t## Commands\n12\t\n13\t4. A command is a pure function over the cart in `src/commands/`; it returns the new cart and does not print.\n14\t5. No new dependencies; the desk machines install nothing.\n15\t\n16\t## Tests\n17\t\n18\t6. Tests live in `test/` and run with `node --test`.\n19\t","served":"live","truncated":false,"wall_ms":0},"hash":"sha256:89eadb9e707483406ec282c2bdc182a130c874eaada728a1c7df67c1d3c2ac0e","mono_ns":12000000,"prev":"sha256:8f2da9f10ff0da56c91eb984903044528864f4c32374ec727015b65afbdf1918","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":12,"session":"1f43b662-0f57-4217-99ac-2dd6b43c6e2f","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.012Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_result"}
