{"agent":"main","body":{"error":null,"exit":0,"for_seq":13,"result_bytes":370,"result_hash":"sha256:8f38d7fd9cf4bd730341386c551e504c53978ea98cdd9ce1d0225c70bea82147","result_inline":"1\t# Error codes\n2\t\n3\tEvery code cartctl can print, in the format `error <code>: <message>`.\n4\t\n5\t| code | message | when |\n6\t|---|---|---|\n7\t| E_UNKNOWN_SKU | unknown sku | the sku is not in the catalogue |\n8\t| E_EMPTY_CART | cart is empty | checkout was asked for an empty cart |\n9\t| E_USAGE | usage: cartctl add <sku> <qty> | the command line could not be parsed |\n10\t","served":"live","truncated":false,"wall_ms":0},"hash":"sha256:91415c891eb1fda1826ca2aab0e42386531acf7a39984b7eb64f9bdb02e4c310","mono_ns":14000000,"prev":"sha256:a994cae19d0a119b9e2023ae29dff8a1a24c9aa93874be753bdc8d9eef0b6f8c","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":14,"session":"1f43b662-0f57-4217-99ac-2dd6b43c6e2f","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.014Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_result"}
